  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/47222907\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/47222907</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Ghost apple: how the polar vortex creates the illusion - CBBC Newsround\" data-og-description=\"A farmer in Michigan, USA have found what are known as ‘ghost apples’, but what are they, and how are they formed?\" data-og-host=\"www.bbc.co.uk\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/47222907\" data-og-url=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/47222907\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/lpbTM/hyMtJv3zVn/o1kPAjEZVsIA1Y1R61jhWk/img.jpg?width=464&amp;height=261&amp;face=0_0_464_261\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/47222907\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/newsround/47222907\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/lpbTM/hyMtJv3zVn/o1kPAjEZVsIA1Y1R61jhWk/img.jpg?width=464&amp;height=261&amp;face=0_0_464_261)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Ghost apple: how the polar vortex creates the illusion - CBBC Newsround</p><p class=\"og-desc\">A farmer in Michigan, USA have found what are known as ‘ghost apples’, but what are they, and how are they formed?</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.bbc.co.uk</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>수업 시간에 오렌지에 물을 뿌려 오렌지가 어는 것을 막는다는 부분에서 한 학생이 알려주더라구요.&#160;<br>사진이 멋있어서 공유해봅니다~&#160;<br>비가 와서 사과 주위에 빗물이 얼었는데 사과는 얼지 않고 썩어서 매달려있다가 농장 주인이 사과 나무를 흔들었을 때 얼음 안의 썩은 사과가 미끄러져 쏟아지고 얼음만 남은 거라고 하네요~&#160;<br>어쨌든 응고열 방출? 맞는거죠? ^-^<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
